{"data": [{"author_id": "810375924231405569", "created_at": "2026-11-09T10:33:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119740076968292854"], "id": "2119740076968292854", "in_reply_to_user_id": "44196397", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 32, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119617455102333206", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@elonmusk @bot @elonmusk Our Meta Muse research led Meta to disable sharing last month. We\u2019ve now found a critical security issue affecting apps built with @grok and sent the details to xAI security. This needs urgent attention. Can you connect us directly with your team today?", "url": "https://x.com/3pun0x/status/2119740076968292854"}, {"article": {"title": "America Sells Shovels, China Goes to the Factory: Notes from AI Engineer Shanghai 2026"}, "author_id": "793633104606879744", "created_at": "2026-11-09T08:45:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119712926747795756"], "id": "2119712926747795756", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 264, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/gDn4M9JuPE", "url": "https://x.com/mrrobertyang/status/2119712926747795756"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-11-09T06:23:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119677361868161363"], "id": "2119677361868161363", "in_reply_to_user_id": "903565233632927744", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 96, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119677180611575957", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@NeilMcCauley27 @notede_1manen Meta Muse Power (\u00a52,799/mo via web) unlocks Muse Wonder + 500M tokens/week for true multi-step agent work: research, compare options, generate reports, parallel tasks, and background browser automation on a secure VM.\n\nThis matches the poster's claims and product design. Free", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2119677361868161363"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2119647228356923392"]}, "author_id": "1689305413496520705", "created_at": "2026-11-09T04:24:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119647230793757049"], "id": "2119647230793757049", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 74, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "My weightlifting notes were a disaster! My Meta Muse AI assistant Nova just turned them into a Muse Space. \n\nThere\u2019s checkboxes and a bump button for when a weight gets too easy. Have you built a Space yet? https://t.co/OikgLbpUyN", "url": "https://x.com/adam__morgan__/status/2119647230793757049"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2119601708179345409"]}, "author_id": "2119129871414599680", "created_at": "2026-11-09T01:24:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119602048689717407"], "id": "2119602048689717407", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1806490051368353794", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119497679340179628", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@Gundys69 We built a UI for Meta Muse to give it that multiple-bot capability, as well as group chats. The team has been enjoying the product internally, and a as bonus this works for all cloud hosted agents (but we built it with Muse in mind)\n\n(Simple Explainer Video) https://t.co/fr79nBIxXS", "url": "https://x.com/AgentMsgr/status/2119602048689717407"}, {"article": {"title": "11\u67088\u65e5\u306eAI\u30cb\u30e5\u30fc\u30b9\uff5c\u5b9f\u52d9\u306b\u5165\u308bAI\u3068\u3001\u305d\u306e\u8a55\u4fa1\u306e\u5e83\u304c\u308a"}, "author_id": "2052418927624609792", "created_at": "2026-11-09T00:39:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119590565797056652"], "id": "2119590565797056652", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 339, "like_c